  "details": "I and most likely many others believe that the camera is less-than ideal. And I believe it just needs some very simple improvements.\n\nTo begin:\n\n-Fix an issue where the laser pointer won't show up when your hand is too close to the camera.\n\n-Add the ability to use UI touch controls (Being able to interact with the UI like a touch screen). This should also become a feature across all UIs like the Quick Menu.\n\n-Add Video Mode to the camera. And also being able to change resolution, bitrate, and video codes.\n\n-Also add an option to make any picture taken get copied to the clipboard \n\nI hope you guys take my suggestions into consideration. I think they would be a great change.",
